{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, craft and hunt to survive the harsh Wild West</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle brutal weather conditions and endure the unforgiving elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and establish camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm and harvest crops and grow food to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant but dangerous Wild West</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or in up to 4 player co-op multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red Rust Pioneers combines the survival mechanics of <i>ARK: Survival Evolved</i>, <i>The Forest</i>, <i>7 Days to Die</i>, <i>Valheim</i> and <i>Rust </i>with the Wild West environments<i> of Red Dead Redemption 2 and Outlaws of the Old West.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/Axe.gif?t=1749575041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded in the harsh Wild West wilderness, you have one job: to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your hunger, thirst and warmth levels to make sure you live to see another sunrise in this unforgiving but beautiful land. Forage, hunt wildlife and fish for food. Gather resources to craft the tools and weapons you\u2019ll need to have any chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you master the elements and withstand blistering heat, violent rainstorms and freezing cold winters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/Camp_Blueprint.gif?t=1749575041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should you beat the odds and live, alone or with up to three friends, you\u2019ll find yourself in a gorgeous, rugged, vibrant land. Will you be able to not only survive, but thrive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and grow your camp your way with easy to use base building mechanics. Farm and harvest a variety of crops to establish a self-sufficient camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/Campfire.gif?t=1749575041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully realized, open world, fictionalized Wild West and become the first to discover the untamed wilderness of Red Rust. If you can endure the threat of extreme hunger, brutal weather conditions and lethal wildlife you may just live to appreciate it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664440?t=1749575041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664440?t=1749575041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/2f57853170b31b5640224d9e6f9755c9a4b9b655/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749575041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/2f57853170b31b5640224d9e6f9755c9a4b9b655/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749575041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, craft and hunt to survive the harsh Wild West</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle brutal weather conditions and endure the unforgiving elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and establish camps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm and harvest crops and grow food to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant but dangerous Wild West</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or in up to 4 player co-op multiplayer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red Rust Pioneers combines the survival mechanics of <i>ARK: Survival Evolved</i>, <i>The Forest</i>, <i>7 Days to Die</i>, <i>Valheim</i> and <i>Rust </i>with the Wild West environments<i> of Red Dead Redemption 2 and Outlaws of the Old West.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/Axe.gif?t=1749575041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded in the harsh Wild West wilderness, you have one job: to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your hunger, thirst and warmth levels to make sure you live to see another sunrise in this unforgiving but beautiful land. Forage, hunt wildlife and fish for food. Gather resources to craft the tools and weapons you\u2019ll need to have any chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you master the elements and withstand blistering heat, violent rainstorms and freezing cold winters?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/Camp_Blueprint.gif?t=1749575041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Should you beat the odds and live, alone or with up to three friends, you\u2019ll find yourself in a gorgeous, rugged, vibrant land. Will you be able to not only survive, but thrive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and grow your camp your way with easy to use base building mechanics. Farm and harvest a variety of crops to establish a self-sufficient camp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/extras/Campfire.gif?t=1749575041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully realized, open world, fictionalized Wild West and become the first to discover the untamed wilderness of Red Rust. If you can endure the threat of extreme hunger, brutal weather conditions and lethal wildlife you may just live to appreciate it.</p>","developers":["Rusty Robot"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664440/f37218363a1224942285bbeb8ae2604b9ff60195/header.jpg?t=1749575041","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Excalibur Games \u00a9 2025 - All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136921,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136921/movie480.mp4?t=1747053953","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136921/movie_max.mp4?t=1747053953"},"name":"Red Rust Pioneers Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136921/30b057f2c17aa2e0c419eac5d4e63195a657c748/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747053953","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136921/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747053953","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136921/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747053953"}}],"name":"Red Rust Pioneers: Multiplayer Western Survival Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64bit OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or above<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060, 6GB, AMD Radeon RX 5600XT and above<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li>